@base = http://localhost:8001
@token = paste-access-token
@categoryId = paste-category-id

### Register
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"developer@example.com","password":"Change-this-example-password-123"}

### Login (username is the email). Copy access_token to @token.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=developer%40example.com&password=Change-this-example-password-123

### Create category. Copy id to @categoryId.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Food"}

### Create expense
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"category_id":"{{categoryId}}","amount":"35000.50","currency":"COP","kind":"expense","description":"Lunch","occurred_on":"2026-10-31"}

### Filtered history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?currency=COP&kind=expense&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly report
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/monthly?year=2026&month=10&currency=COP
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
